    "body": "https://github.com/tidoust/reffy-reports/tree/master/whatwg/idl is the source of the IDL files in WPT and what I've been treating as \"all the web's IDL\" for some time now.\r\n\r\nI just finished fixing specs missed in the `[NoInterfaceObject] interface`+`implements` to `interface mixin`+`includes` transition, so making sure *all* changes have propagated to reffy-reports before using `[Constructor]` becomes invalid and is dropped from webidl2.js would be much appreciated.",
