    "updated_at": "2019-08-13T10:19:26Z",
    "body": "I'm expecting to file spec bugs based on a combination of scraping browser source code and adding errors in idlharness.js.\r\n\r\nI think changing NamedConstructor as well would make sense, but don't have a timeline for that yet.",
