    "created_at": "2019-08-13T14:31:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-13T14:31:47Z",
    "body": "I'm not so sure about NamedConstructor, since that adds a factory function to the global, and doesn't add a member of the class (or effect the class in any way). Keeping it as-is seems better to me... Or if anything, making it a separate top-level declaration.",
